=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : 3 reads bound as StateFlow via EnergyPageViewModel -> energyPageSourceOf(): EnergyStore.energyStats(id,30) (web useEnergyStats; PRIMARY),
               page-local HttpChargingRepository.sessionsPaginated(id,100,0,start,end) (web useChargingSessionsPaginated; typed List<ChargingSession>),
               VehiclesStore.chargingTelemetryLatest(id) (web useChargingTelemetryLatest). Scope = SelectedVehicleStore (web useSelectedVehicle);
               units/currency = SettingsStore.settings() (web useUnits/useFormatting). No HTTP in the view; no DataContainer edit needed.
charts       : 4 RadialGauge + 4 ChartContainer + ComboChart + AreaChartWrapper + BarChartWrapper from the A3 components.charts library (Vico);
               the charger-type pie is a Compose-Canvas donut+legend authored in the page (A3 ships no pie wrapper) — Compose-native, never a webview = 12.
si/units     : SI read off the wire; energy Wh via convertEnergyFromSI(prefs.fromWh), distance m via convertDistanceFromSI(prefs.fromMeters), power W via
               convertPowerFromSI(prefs.fromWatts), efficiency Wh/m->Wh/km|Wh/mi via prefs.toEfficiencyDisplay — all at the display boundary only. CO2 kg + $
               rendered verbatim (web parity). Every web derivation formula reproduced (cost/m, cost/kWh, 30-day monthly/yearly projection, gas-equivalent,
               both efficiency-gauge scalings) in the framework-free EnergyDerived (JVM-tested by testDebugUnitTest).
states       : energy-stats is the PRIMARY gate (loading/error/success). The body renders on every non-loading/non-error state so no section is hidden
               (web behaviour). The empty state is the honest empty hero (web hasNoEnergyData: no sessions AND no stats signal) plus each chart's ChartStatus.Empty
               and the recent-sessions EmptyState — never a page-level blank, never a grid of zeros.
a11y/theme   : charts carry accessibleDescription (the web aria-labels); the bar/combo/area expose the screen-reader data table via ChartContainer; the donut legend
               is TalkBack-readable; each gauge has a merged contentDescription; SectionHeader rows carry a semantics contentDescription; icons decorative
               (contentDescription=null); all color via MaterialTheme.colorScheme + chart ChartPalette (A2 tokens) — dynamic color + dark theme; typography via the
               role components (PageTitle/PanelTitle/BodyText/Caption/MetricValue/MetricLabel). Compose-native (no webview).
nav          : Destinations 'energy' -> /energy pre-existing (Destinations.kt L78, count unchanged); host wired via PageHosts.register("energy"); deep link
